35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, the log shows nine conflicts died because no one owned them. I need to know if the sticker register reflects actual daily use or just who claimed first.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
