37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the rain data confirms the eaves are the only dry zone. The frame trial shows hoisting takes twenty seconds. We need a system that respects these physical limits.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, the ledger is empty. Any new system means a levy on every household. I need to know the actual cost of a bike left in the rain before we debate fairness.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the ledger is empty, but the burden is real. The neighbouring block’s monthly charge caused arrears and silence. We need a system that doesn’t rely on constant enforcement.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, silence is the worst outcome. The log shows nine conflicts died because no one owned them. We need a structure that prevents that, not just a fee.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
